hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1523","Al-Rabi’ bin Sulayman Al-Muradi told us, on the authority of Al-Shafi’i, Sufyan told us, Al-A’mash told us, on the authority of Ibrahim, on the authority of Hammam, he said: He prayed with us Hudhayfah was on a high bench, so he prostrated on it, and Abu Masoud pulled him down, so Hudhayfah followed him. When he finished the prayer, Abu Masoud said: “Isn’t it forbidden?” About this?” Hudhayfah said to him: “Did you not see that I followed you?”"
